{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54978","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帅衣服，无故血痕班。\n防有奸人（京本作「备奸谋」）来害己，急须焚毁祸回还，不尔将（京本作「帅」）遭殃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}